===============================================================================
WHAT THIS COVERS, AND WHAT IT DOES NOT
===============================================================================

The Unlicense above applies to everything in this repository that was written
for it:

  * the Android application source, under app/src/
  * the vendored FSRS v6 module, under fsrs/
  * the generated kana table, app/src/main/assets/kana.json
  * the asset build scripts under tools/
  * the documentation

It does NOT apply to material that came from elsewhere and is included here
under someone else's licence. That material keeps its own licence, and none of
it is relicensed by the paragraph above:

  * app/src/main/assets/kanjivg/*.svg
      KanjiVG. Copyright 2009-2024 Ulrich Apel and contributors.
      Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0.
      https://kanjivg.tagaini.net/

  * app/src/main/assets/kanji.json
      A derivative of KANJIDIC2. Copyright James William Breen and the
      Electronic Dictionary Research and Development Group.
      Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0.
      https://www.edrdg.org/edrdg/licence.html
      It also carries example words derived from open-anki-jlpt-decks,
      MIT, copyright 2020 Jamie Sinclair.

  * ML Kit and Google Play Services are build dependencies. They are not
      distributed in this repository. See ATTRIBUTION.md.

In short: if you redistribute this project, the code is yours to do with as you
please, but the stroke diagrams and the kanji data must be credited and must
stay under CC BY-SA. Both obligations are met by keeping ATTRIBUTION.md and the
in-app licences screen (Settings -> Licences) with whatever you ship.

One detail this project relies on: the KanjiVG files are included unmodified,
which keeps them a collection rather than an adaptation, so the ShareAlike term
bears on the diagrams themselves and not on the application around them. If you
edit those files - recolouring them, converting them to another format - the
result becomes an adaptation and inherits CC BY-SA 3.0.
